                <tr><td style="padding:10px 12px 0 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#8fd8ee;"><span style="color:#de6a09;">✈</span> МОСКВА:</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 12px 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#d5e9ef;line-height:1.4;">проспект Андропова, 11, корпус 2, Южный Event-Port.</td></tr>
              </table>
            </td>
            <td class="gate-td" width="4%" style="font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td>
            <td class="gate-td" width="48%" valign="top" style="padding:0 0 0 8px;">
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border:1px dashed #1f5c6e;border-radius:6px;background-color:#002a37;">
                <tr><td style="padding:10px 12px 0 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;color:#8fd8ee;"><span style="color:#de6a09;">✈</span> УФА:</td></tr>
                <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 12px 12px;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#d5e9ef;line-height:1.4;">улица Менделеева, 205А, ресторан «Пастернак».</td></tr>
              </table>
